; 0_mml_example_a — bright arcade menu loop (C major)
; SSG carries the melody, ADPCM-B TRACK under, FM lead on top.

T140
@p1
@b0
@f0
V12
O5
L8

; phrase A — call
C E G E  C E G4
< G E C E  G E C4

; phrase B — answer
> D F A F  D F A4
< A F D F  A F D4

; phrase C — lift
> E G > C < G  E G > C4
< F A > C < A  F A > C4

; phrase D — resolve
< C E G E  D F A F
E G > C < G  > C4 R4

~
